BEESWAX CHANGELOG

1.00: Proof of concept released

1.01 / 1.0.1:

- Added coupon descriptions and rating system

  1.02:

- Updated ui to show top 3 rated coupons
- Added coupon expiry dates and seasonal coupons
- Added firefox support
- Moved database to NoSQL
- Made regular browsing anonymous through k-anonymity

  1.03:

- Added user login with persistent jwt
- Modified coupon schema to include list of users rated to reduce spams

Future plans:

- Account system to handle spam and malicious inputes
- Enter in coupon using web scrapers
